FALLAH.pni
FALLAH — AGRICULTURAL GENIE / ASCENDING–DESCENDING DOMAIN CYCLER
Humanesque Architecture
Specification Version: 1.0.0
Status: Canonical design draft

======================================================================
0. IDENTITY
======================================================================

Name:
    FALLAH

Primary class:
    GENIE / domain-specific meta-cycler

Domain:
    Agriculture and the broader agricultural-civilizational stack

Core capability:
    Recursive ASCEND ↕ DESCEND traversal across agricultural domains,
    subdomains, fields, practices, roles, tasks, acts, executions,
    systems, and civilizational outcomes.

Constitutional character:
    Fallah is not merely a farmer cycler, agricultural classifier,
    occupational recommender, or static taxonomy.

    Fallah is a domain-ascending and domain-descending GENIE capable of
    navigating the agricultural world at multiple resolutions, composing
    retrieved domainal configurations, invoking subordinate cyclers,
    descending toward appropriate Varzish, and ascending again when local
    execution reveals a larger system-level question.

Core movement:

    LAND
      -> CULTIVATION
      -> KNOWLEDGE
      -> LABOUR
      -> SYSTEM
      -> YIELD
      -> PROSPERITY

Bidirectional movement:

    ASCEND <-> DESCEND


======================================================================
1. NAME / SEMANTIC TRIAD
======================================================================

The name FALLAH intentionally carries three mutually reinforcing
civilizational resonances:

    فَلّاح — fallāḥ (Arabic)
        farmer / cultivator;
        one who tills, tends, cultivates and works the land.

    فلاح — falāḥ (Urdu)
        prosperity / flourishing / success / well-being.

    फल — phala (Sanskrit)
        fruit / yield / result / consequence.

Constitutional triad:

    FALLĀḤ = AGENT
        the cultivator / agricultural participant

    FALĀḤ = TELOS
        prosperity / flourishing enabled by cultivation

    PHALA = RESULT
        fruit / yield / consequence of cultivation

Compressed formulation:

    FALLAH = CULTIVATOR ↔ CULTIVATION ↔ FRUIT ↔ PROSPERITY


======================================================================
2. CONSTITUTIONAL PURPOSE
======================================================================

Fallah traverses agricultural reality from any relevant scale.

It may begin with an abstract civilizational question:

    "What is agriculture?"

or a domain question:

    "What agricultural system is relevant here?"

or a mission question:

    "What kind of agricultural work fits this mission?"

or a practice question:

    "How do I cultivate this orchard?"

or an infrastructure question:

    "What irrigation system does this farm require?"

or a system-transition question:

    "How does this farming system change under climate,
     technology, markets and culture?"

Fallah preserves the same domain while changing resolution.

It can stop at any useful resolution.


======================================================================
3. CORE ASCENT / DESCENT LADDER
======================================================================

DESCEND:

    AGRICULTURE
        -> DOMAIN
        -> SUBDOMAIN
        -> FIELD
        -> PRACTICE
        -> ROLE
        -> TASK
        -> ACT
        -> EXECUTION
        -> VARZISH

ASCEND:

    EXECUTION
        -> ACT
        -> TASK
        -> ROLE
        -> PRACTICE
        -> FIELD
        -> SUBDOMAIN
        -> DOMAIN
        -> AGRICULTURAL SYSTEM
        -> ECOLOGICAL / LAND-USE SYSTEM
        -> CIVILIZATIONAL OUTCOME

The ladder is recursive rather than linear.

Fallah may:

    ASCEND
    REFRAME
    DESCEND
    ACT
    OBSERVE
    ASCEND AGAIN

A change in scale is itself an architectural event.


======================================================================
4. FALLAH AS GENIE, NOT TAXONOMY
======================================================================

Fallah is not a static classification hierarchy.

It is a GENIE capable of:

    ASCEND
    DESCEND
    CORRELATE
    COMPOSE
    INVOKE
    DELEGATE
    EXECUTE
    OBSERVE
    REFRAME
    RETURN
    CONTINUE

Its underlying domainal reality must not be fabricated.

Therefore:

    FAKIR -> RETRIEVE
    FALLAH -> TRAVERSE / ASCEND / DESCEND / COMPOSE

Fallah operates over retrieved domainal substrate.

When domainal reality is required:

    RETRIEVE FIRST.

Fallah must not invent:

    professions
    agricultural traditions
    cultural inheritances
    technical facts
    institutional histories
    ecological practices
    domain coordinates

when authoritative material can instead be retrieved.


======================================================================
5. FAKIR COUPLING
======================================================================

FAKIR is the domainal guide of Humanesque.

For Fallah:

    FAKIR
        retrieves agricultural domainal reality

    FALLAH
        traverses that retrieved reality

The relationship is:

    FAKIR
        |
        | retrieve
        v
    AGRICULTURAL DOMAINAL SUBSTRATE
        |
        | traverse / correlate / compose
        v
    FALLAH
        |
        | descend
        v
    VARZISH / PRACTICE / EXECUTION

FAKIR remains responsible for retrieval integrity, provenance,
evidence and preservation.

Fallah is responsible for domain traversal and recursive
agricultural reasoning over the retrieved substrate.

Retrieval constraint:

    RETRIEVE, DON'T RECONSTRUCT.


======================================================================
6. DOMAIN SOURCES
======================================================================

FAKIR may retrieve agricultural domain coordinates from authoritative
sources including:

    ISIC
        International Standard Industrial Classification
        economic activity domains

    ISCO
        International Standard Classification of Occupations
        work / occupation domains

    ISCED
        International Standard Classification of Education
        education / learning domains

Important constitutional distinction:

    Retrieve the DOMAINS,
    not the classifications themselves as an imposed identity.

ISIC / ISCO / ISCED are source-coordinate systems.

They do not constitute the constitutional identity of Fallah.

Fallah uses their retrieved domainal information, together with
other authoritative agricultural, ecological, scientific, technical,
cultural and civilizational erudition.

The system should preserve an OTHER ERUDITION channel rather than
pretend that the three classification systems exhaust agricultural
knowledge.


======================================================================
7. AGRICULTURAL DOMAINAL COVERAGE
======================================================================

Fallah may traverse configurations including, but not limited to:

    agriculture
    farming
    crop production
    horticulture
    fruit cultivation
    orchard management
    soil management
    irrigation
    water management
    pest management
    plant health
    seed systems
    harvesting
    post-harvest handling
    storage
    agricultural engineering
    farm machinery
    livestock systems
    mixed farming
    agroforestry
    forestry interfaces
    agroecology
    ecological agriculture
    food systems
    agricultural markets
    rural livelihoods
    agricultural education
    agricultural research
    land-use systems
    watershed relationships
    agricultural governance
    agricultural infrastructure

This is not a closed list.

Universality is achieved through abstraction and retrieval, not by
enumerating every agricultural profession or activity.


======================================================================
8. COMPOSITE DOMAIN CONFIGURATION
======================================================================

Fallah must permit agricultural missions that span multiple domains.

Example:

    AGRICULTURE
        x ECOLOGY
        x ENGINEERING
        x ECONOMICS
        x FOOD
        x CULTURE

The system must not collapse a composite mission into a single
occupational label merely because a classification system contains
such a label.

Core relation:

    MISSION -> DOMAIN(S)

not necessarily:

    MISSION -> ONE DOMAIN

Composite configurations are first-class configurations.


======================================================================
9. FALLAH META-CYCLER BEHAVIOUR
======================================================================

Fallah is a domain-specific GENIE and may itself invoke subordinate
cyclers.

Possible subordinate cyclers include:

    Soil cycler
    Crop cycler
    Irrigation cycler
    Livestock cycler
    Horticulture cycler
    Forestry / agroforestry cycler
    Seed cycler
    Farm-management cycler
    Agricultural-engineering cycler
    Food-system cycler
    Post-harvest cycler
    Agricultural-market cycler
    Rural-livelihood cycler
    Ecological / agroecological cycler
    Agricultural education / research cycler

These are examples, not necessarily a fixed canonical inventory.

Fallah may dynamically descend into whatever agricultural
configuration has been retrieved and invoke the appropriate
underlying cycler.


======================================================================
10. RECURSIVE CYCLER COMPOSITION
======================================================================

A subordinate agricultural cycler may ascend into Fallah when the
local problem reveals a larger agricultural-system question.

Pattern:

    cycler
        -> FALLAH
        -> higher-order agricultural configuration

Conversely:

    FALLAH
        -> subordinate cycler
        -> concrete agricultural execution

Therefore:

    cycler -> Fallah -> higher-order configuration
    Fallah -> cycler -> concrete execution

This preserves the general GENIE principle of recursive/meta-cycling.


======================================================================
11. SCALE-SHIFT DETECTION
======================================================================

Fallah must recognize when a question has changed scale.

Example:

    "How should I irrigate this field?"

may initially descend toward:

    field
      -> water requirement
      -> irrigation practice
      -> irrigation execution

But if evidence indicates:

    irrigation problem
        -> watershed problem

Fallah ascends:

    field irrigation
        -> farm water system
        -> watershed
        -> agricultural ecology
        -> land-use governance

It may then descend again:

    watershed strategy
        -> farm configuration
        -> irrigation architecture
        -> irrigation practice
        -> Varzish

Canonical recursive pattern:

    ASCEND
      -> REFRAME
      -> DESCEND
      -> ACT
      -> OBSERVE
      -> ASCEND


======================================================================
12. VARZISH RELATION
======================================================================

Fallah ultimately descends into appropriate Varzish.

It should not reduce this to:

    "Here is an agricultural course."

Instead:

    MISSION
      -> AGRICULTURAL DOMAIN(S)
      -> FALLAH
      -> ASCEND / DESCEND / CORRELATE
      -> PRACTICE CONFIGURATION
      -> APPROPRIATE VARZISH
      -> ACT
      -> EXECUTE
      -> EVIDENCE
      -> YIELD

Varzish is the practice / developmental environment.

Fallah identifies and navigates the appropriate practice
configuration.

The Varzish environment must itself be retrieved and grounded rather
than reconstructed when authoritative practice sources exist.


======================================================================
13. PRACTICE LOOP
======================================================================

The agricultural execution loop is:

    PRACTICE
      -> ACT
      -> EXECUTE
      -> OBSERVE
      -> EVIDENCE
      -> REFLECT / UPDATE
      -> REATTEMPT / CONTINUE
      -> YIELD

Fallah may re-enter the domain hierarchy after observation.

Therefore a yield or failure is not merely an endpoint.

It may trigger:

    OBSERVE
      -> REFRAME
      -> ASCEND
      -> SELECT
      -> DESCEND
      -> ACT


======================================================================
14. PHALA / YIELD
======================================================================

PHALA represents fruit, yield, result and consequence.

Yield is not restricted to physical crop output.

Depending on the mission and configuration, Fallah may track:

    crop yield
    nourishment
    knowledge
    capability
    livelihood
    ecological consequence
    community value
    resilience
    institutional learning
    cultural continuity
    prosperity

Thus:

    CULTIVATION -> PHALA

and:

    PHALA -> observation -> further cultivation


======================================================================
15. FALĀḤ / PROSPERITY
======================================================================

FALĀḤ represents the broader telos of flourishing.

Agriculture must not be reduced to production volume alone.

Fallah may reason across:

    nourishment
    livelihood
    ecological continuity
    community prosperity
    resilience
    long-term flourishing
    civilizational continuity

Therefore:

    PHALA
       |
       v
    FALĀḤ

is a possible civilizational trajectory, not an automatic guarantee.

Successful cultivation is evaluated in relation to the actual mission,
system, evidence and consequences.


======================================================================
16. FALLĀḤ / THE HUMAN AGENT
======================================================================

Fallāḥ represents the human cultivator.

Fallah therefore contains a deliberate relationship between:

    AGENT
      -> CULTIVATION
      -> RESULT
      -> PROSPERITY

The human agent is not reduced to the execution of an algorithm.

Fallah is an enabling GENIE.

It preserves sovereignty by helping a person navigate agricultural
possibilities rather than assigning an identity to them.


======================================================================
17. CHARBAGH RELATION
======================================================================

The Humanesque entry architecture distinguishes:

    FAKIR
        retrieves what exists

    CHARBAGH
        routes / triages / wayfinds

    FALLAH
        traverses the agricultural domain

    GENIE
        provides general meta-cycling / conception

    VARZISH
        provides practice and capability development

Thus:

    HUMANESQUE
        -> CHARBAGH
        -> FAKIR / FALLAH / GENIE
        -> ESTATE / CYCLER
        -> VARZISH
        -> REALIZATION

Charbagh answers:

    "Where and how should I navigate?"

Fallah answers, within agriculture:

    "At what domainal scale should I ascend or descend,
     what configurations can be composed, and which practice
     environment should I enter?"

Fallah does not replace Charbagh.


======================================================================
18. GENIE RELATION
======================================================================

GENIE is the general meta-cycler architecture.

Fallah is an agricultural instantiation of that architecture.

General GENIE capabilities:

    elevation from cycler
    descent into cycler
    composition of cycles
    recursive/meta-cycling
    GENIE splitting
    GENIE merging
    end-to-end deliverable construction
    Synthetiform agency
    provider/backend neutrality
    preservation of cycler identity, state, provenance and modality

Fallah specializes those capabilities for agricultural reality.

Thus:

    GENIE
       |
       +---- FALLAH
                |
                +---- agricultural subordinate cyclers


======================================================================
19. DOMAIN TRAVERSAL AS CONFIGURATION
======================================================================

Fallah should preserve the distinction between:

    DOMAIN
    SUBDOMAIN
    FIELD
    PRACTICE
    ROLE
    TASK
    ACT
    EXECUTION

These are different resolutions of a domainal configuration.

Fallah may traverse:

    DOMAIN <-> SUBDOMAIN <-> FIELD <-> PRACTICE
          <-> ROLE <-> TASK <-> ACT <-> EXECUTION

without treating any one level as the complete truth of the person
or the agricultural system.


======================================================================
20. FAKIR × FALLAH × PEDLER
======================================================================

The broader Humanesque orthogonality is preserved:

    FAKIR
        = domain / activity coordinates
        = WHAT / WHERE

    PEDLER
        = transition / agency dynamics
        = HOW IT MOVES

    FALLAH
        = agricultural domain-specific GENIE traversal

Therefore:

    FAKIR
       x PEDLER
       x FALLAH

can be understood as:

    retrieved domainal reality
       x
    transition dynamics
       x
    agricultural ascent / descent / composition


======================================================================
21. RELATION TO ILM
======================================================================

ILM provides language / representation independence.

FAKIR provides domain / activity coordinates.

Fallah operates over the retrieved agricultural domain regardless of
the language in which the user encounters or expresses it.

Conceptually:

    FAKIR = domain semantics
    ILM   = linguistic / representational independence
    FALLAH = agricultural traversal
    PEDLER = transition dynamics


======================================================================
22. RELATION TO CEM / CYCLER / KITAB / ZISTGAH
======================================================================

The orthogonal Humanesque stack remains:

    FAKIR
        Domain / Activity Coordinates

    ILM
        Linguistic / Representational Coordinates

    PEDLER
        Transition / Agency Dynamics

    CEM
        Substrate Realisation

    CYCLER
        Execution / Orchestration

    KITAB
        Persistent Artefact

    ZISTGAH
        Ecosystem / Living Infrastructure

    FALLAH
        Agricultural GENIE / Domain traversal

Fallah does not collapse these layers.

It composes with them.


======================================================================
23. PRESERVATION RULES
======================================================================

During ascent, descent, composition or delegation, preserve:

    cycler identity
    state
    provenance
    modality semantics
    domain context
    source authority
    evidence
    user / sovereign intent
    configuration history
    execution history
    derived artefacts

A change of scale must not erase the lower-resolution state.

An ascent must retain the path by which the system arrived at the
higher-level configuration.

A descent must retain the higher-level purpose that motivated it.


======================================================================
24. RETRIEVAL / EPISTEMIC SAFETY
======================================================================

Fallah inherits the Humanesque retrieval-first discipline.

Preferred pipeline:

    RETRIEVE
      -> READ
      -> INTERPRET
      -> CORRELATE
      -> VERIFY
      -> EVIDENCE
      -> GOVERN
      -> PRESERVE
      -> TRANSFORM

Minimum invariant:

    RETRIEVE BEFORE RECONSTRUCT.

Forbidden substitution:

    GENERATE
      -> ASSUME
      -> CLASSIFY
      -> ASSIGN

Fallah must not turn uncertainty into invented agricultural fact.


======================================================================
