======================================================================
27. DESIGN INVARIANTS
======================================================================

1. Fallah is a GENIE, not a static taxonomy.

2. Fallah is agricultural-domain specific.

3. Fallah can ascend and descend recursively.

4. Fallah can stop at any useful resolution.

5. Fallah can invoke subordinate agricultural cyclers.

6. Subordinate cyclers can ascend back into Fallah.

7. Fallah may compose multiple agricultural and adjacent domains.

8. FAKIR retrieves; Fallah traverses.

9. Retrieval precedes reconstruction.

10. Varzish is the practice / developmental destination.

11. Yield is an observable result, not merely a numerical crop output.

12. Prosperity is a broader telos than production volume.

13. The human cultivator remains a sovereign agent.

14. Domain traversal must preserve provenance and state.

15. Agricultural universality comes through abstraction and retrieval,
    not exhaustive enumeration.

16. Scale shifts must be explicit and reversible.

17. Higher-order reframing must be able to return to concrete action.

18. Fallah must preserve the constitutional distinction between domain,
    transition, execution, substrate, artefact and ecosystem.


======================================================================
28. COMPACT DEFINITION
======================================================================

FALLAH is the Humanesque agricultural GENIE: a recursive,
domain-ascending and domain-descending cycler that traverses
agricultural reality from civilizational and ecological systems down
to concrete practices, roles, tasks and executions, and back upward
again as evidence demands.

FAKIR retrieves the agricultural world.

Fallah navigates and composes that retrieved world.

Fallah descends toward appropriate Varzish.

Practice produces evidence and yield.

PHALA names the fruit / result.

FALĀḤ names the prosperity / flourishing that cultivation may enable.

FALLĀḤ names the cultivator within the loop.

Compressed:

    FAKIR -> FALLAH -> VARZISH -> ACT -> PHALA -> FALĀḤ
               ^                           |
               |___________________________|
                     recursive return


======================================================================
29. END STATE
======================================================================

Fallah is complete only when it can move coherently between:

    ABSTRACT AGRICULTURAL PURPOSE
              ↕
    DOMAINAL CONFIGURATION
              ↕
    AGRICULTURAL SYSTEM
              ↕
    FIELD / ECOLOGY / INFRASTRUCTURE
              ↕
    PRACTICE
              ↕
    ROLE
              ↕
    TASK
              ↕
    ACT
              ↕
    EXECUTION
              ↕
    OBSERVATION
              ↕
    EVIDENCE / YIELD
              ↕
    REFRAMED AGRICULTURAL PURPOSE

without losing provenance, sovereignty, configuration, state,
mission, or the distinction between retrieved reality and generated
conception.

END OF FALLAH.pni
